# BitCapital Research Pool: structural note for April 2026

## Period overview

This document presents a revised version of the report on BitCapital Research Pool management for April 2026. The material is framed as a research-oriented note in which the result of the period is considered through changes in pool structure, the character of rebalancing, and the profile of risk.

April 2026 may be described as a phase of controlled structural adjustment following the more actively loaded March configuration. The management logic shifted toward increasing the share of liquidity and partially fixing previously expanded positions while maintaining participation in the key risk assets.

## Pool structure at the beginning of the period

At the beginning of April, the pool structure was described as follows:

| Asset | Position parameter | Value in USDT |
|---|---|---:|
| USDT | fixed valuation | 6,945 |
